               <code code="34069-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HOW SUPPLIED SECTION"/>
               <title>HOW SUPPLIED</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Desoximetasone cream, USP 0.05% is supplied in 15 gram (NDC 71656-086-15) and 60 gram (NDC 71656-086-60) tubes.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <br/>  Store at 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F) [See USP Controlled Room Temperature].
